    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i already talked to my doctor a few months ago and they said my bp is mostly stable now. i don't want to deal with the hassle of calling the clinic just for a sinus thing. how much sudafed would be a safe amount if i just took a little bit? like a half dose or something?",
